# Pairs with ClaimsNeverConferTenantGroups. The finding behind D2: a filter that
# follows the flag honours an asserted t/ group while the flag is off, after a
# rollback, or on a lagging silo.
MODULE: ClaimFilterFollowsFlag
TARGET: ClaimsNeverConferTenantGroups
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the claim filter is active only while the resolving silo's delegated-access flag is on
PERTURBS: ResolveClaims

--- FIND
        kept == {g \in asserted : ~(TenancyRegistered /\ IsTier(g)) \/ g \in dir}
--- REPLACE
        kept == {g \in asserted : ~(flag[s] /\ IsTier(g)) \/ g \in dir}
--- END
